    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost lately. everyone i used to know... it's like they all just collectively decided i don't exist anymore. i walked through the quad today and it's like people were literally looking through me. i havent been invited to anything in weeks and i know why. i cant ever go back to how things were. it's just gone.",
